ional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji040-050","subject_person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","quote":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"其母蔡女","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本段明示生育、兄弟、母子及苗裔敘事；祖先不作直接父親，繼位不自動推父子，不補未見母名或闕代。來源主張不等於版本與史實已覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji040-057","subject_person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","quote":"惠王二年，子西召故平王太子建之子勝於呉，以爲巣大夫，號曰白公。白公好兵而下士，欲報仇。六年，白公請兵令尹子西伐鄭。初，白公父建亡在鄭，鄭殺之，白公亡走呉，子西復召之，故以此怨鄭，欲伐之。子西許而未爲發兵。八年，晉伐鄭，鄭告急楚，楚使子西救鄭，受賂而去。白公勝怒，乃遂與勇力死士石乞等襲殺令尹子西、子綦於朝，因劫惠王，置之髙府，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"太子建之子勝","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本段明示生育、兄弟、母子及苗裔敘事；祖先不作直接父親，繼位不自動推父子，不補未見母名或闕代。來源主張不等於版本與史實已覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji042-038","subject_person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","quote":"八年，楚太子建來奔。十年，太子建與晉謀襲鄭。鄭殺建，建子勝奔呉。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"建子勝","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子、少子及弟保存來源主張，繼位不獨作父子，如兄弟不作血親；不補母名、年代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji042-023","person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0","title":"太子","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","quote":"八年，楚太子建來奔。十年，太子建與晉謀襲鄭。鄭殺建，建子勝奔呉。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji042-023:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"太子","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0003","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"自立與既有用稱分開；原文相對年表述未換算，不由死亡、出奔或首次用稱補造起訖。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji040-039","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","surfaces":["太子建","建","楚太子建"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","quote":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","quote":"六年，使太子建居城父，守邊。無忌又日夜讒太子建於王曰：「自無忌入秦女，太子怨，亦不能無望於王，王少自備焉。且太子居城父，擅兵，外交諸侯，且欲入矣。」平王召其傅伍奢責之。伍奢知無忌讒，乃曰：「王柰何以小臣疎骨肉？」無忌曰：「今不制，後悔也。」於是王遂囚伍奢〈而召其二子而告以免父死〉。乃令司馬奮揚召太子建，欲誅之。太子聞之，亡奔宋。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p044","quote":"十年，楚太子建母在居巣，開呉。呉使公子光伐楚，遂敗陳、蔡，取太子建母而去。楚恐，城郢。初，呉之邊邑卑梁與楚邊邑鐘離小童爭桑，兩家交怒相攻，滅卑梁人。卑梁大夫怒，發邑兵攻鐘離。楚王聞之怒，發國兵滅卑梁。呉王聞之大怒，亦發兵，使公子光因建母家攻楚，遂滅鐘離、居巣。楚乃恐而城郢。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p045","quote":"十三年，平王卒。將軍子常曰：「太子珍少，且其母乃前太子建所當娶也。」欲立令尹子西。子西，平王之庶弟也，有義。子西曰：「國有常法，更立則亂，言之則致誅。」乃立太子珍，是爲昭王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","quote":"昭王元年，楚衆不説費無忌，以其讒亡太子建，殺伍奢子父與郤宛。宛之宗姓伯氏子及子胥皆奔呉，呉兵數侵楚，楚人怨無忌甚。楚令尹子常誅無忌以説衆，衆乃喜。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","quote":"惠王二年，子西召故平王太子建之子勝於呉，以爲巣大夫，號曰白公。白公好兵而下士，欲報仇。六年，白公請兵令尹子西伐鄭。初，白公父建亡在鄭，鄭殺之，白公亡走呉，子西復召之，故以此怨鄭，欲伐之。子西許而未爲發兵。八年，晉伐鄭，鄭告急楚，楚使子西救鄭，受賂而去。白公勝怒，乃遂與勇力死士石乞等襲殺令尹子西、子綦於朝，因劫惠王，置之髙府，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示立、是為及連續敘事暫接，未自動與其他篇候選合併；匿名身分、追稱與年代仍待核。 白公父建接續開篇平王太子建之子勝。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji042-113","person_id":"e5t_5l9_wg0","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-042-zheng"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["太子建","建","楚太子建"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","quote":"八年，楚太子建來奔。十年，太子建與晉謀襲鄭。鄭殺建，建子勝奔呉。"}],"rationale":"依本篇名字、是為、世系及連續事件暫接異稱；同諡不同國分開，建子勝與聲公勝不合併，如兄弟為譬喻不作親屬。述贊與正文不算獨立來源，省稱、古字與校勘仍待核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji042-jian","person_ids":["gau_cq7_7g1","e5t_5l9_wg0"],"canonical_person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu","c-shiji-042-zheng"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","quote":"惠王二年，子西召故平王太子建之子勝於呉，以爲巣大夫，號曰白公。白公好兵而下士，欲報仇。六年，白公請兵令尹子西伐鄭。初，白公父建亡在鄭，鄭殺之，白公亡走呉，子西復召之，故以此怨鄭，欲伐之。子西許而未爲發兵。八年，晉伐鄭，鄭告急楚，楚使子西救鄭，受賂而去。白公勝怒，乃遂與勇力死士石乞等襲殺令尹子西、子綦於朝，因劫惠王，置之髙府，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0011","c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0062"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p045","quote":"八年，楚太子建來奔。十年，太子建與晉謀襲鄭。鄭殺建，建子勝奔呉。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0003","c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0013","c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0024","c-shiji-042-zheng:m045-0026"]}],"rationale":"兩篇同記楚太子建亡在鄭而被鄭殺，其子勝亡走吳，按同一父子與逃亡事件暫同指。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","text":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"熊珍","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"蔡女","kind":"person","person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","text":"六年，使太子建居城父，守邊。無忌又日夜讒太子建於王曰：「自無忌入秦女，太子怨，亦不能無望於王，王少自備焉。且太子居城父，擅兵，外交諸侯，且欲入矣。」平王召其傅伍奢責之。伍奢知無忌讒，乃曰：「王柰何以小臣疎骨肉？」無忌曰：「今不制，後悔也。」於是王遂囚伍奢〈而召其二子而告以免父死〉。乃令司馬奮揚召太子建，欲誅之。太子聞之，亡奔宋。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0130","start":130,"end":133,"surface":"其二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"奮揚","kind":"person","person_id":"grj_xg2_ghx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0148","start":148,"end":151,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p044","text":"十年，楚太子建母在居巣，開呉。呉使公子光伐楚，遂敗陳、蔡，取太子建母而去。楚恐，城郢。初，呉之邊邑卑梁與楚邊邑鐘離小童爭桑，兩家交怒相攻，滅卑梁人。卑梁大夫怒，發邑兵攻鐘離。楚王聞之怒，發國兵滅卑梁。呉王聞之大怒，亦發兵，使公子光因建母家攻楚，遂滅鐘離、居巣。楚乃恐而城郢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"楚太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"公子光","kind":"person","person_id":"fxy_b0h_ssn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0074","start":74,"end":78,"surface":"卑梁大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"uik_lg2_lp8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0112","start":112,"end":115,"surface":"公子光","kind":"person","person_id":"fxy_b0h_ssn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m044-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"建母","kind":"person","person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p045","text":"十三年，平王卒。將軍子常曰：「太子珍少，且其母乃前太子建所當娶也。」欲立令尹子西。子西，平王之庶弟也，有義。子西曰：「國有常法，更立則亂，言之則致誅。」乃立太子珍，是爲昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"yy2_ghd_owh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"太子珍","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"yfx_myv_qft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"yfx_myv_qft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"yfx_myv_qft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"太子珍","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","text":"昭王元年，楚衆不説費無忌，以其讒亡太子建，殺伍奢子父與郤宛。宛之宗姓伯氏子及子胥皆奔呉，呉兵數侵楚，楚人怨無忌甚。楚令尹子常誅無忌以説衆，衆乃喜。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"郤宛","kind":"person","person_id":"lqh_592_x11","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"宛","kind":"person","person_id":"lqh_592_x11","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"伯氏子","kind":"person","person_id":"dnz_dal_a9s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"yy2_ghd_owh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","text":"惠王二年，子西召故平王太子建之子勝於呉，以爲巣大夫，號曰白公。白公好兵而下士，欲報仇。六年，白公請兵令尹子西伐鄭。初，白公父建亡在鄭，鄭殺之，白公亡走呉，子西復召之，故以此怨鄭，欲伐之。子西許而未爲發兵。八年，晉伐鄭，鄭告急楚，楚使子西救鄭，受賂而去。白公勝怒，乃遂與勇力死士石乞等襲殺令尹子西、子綦於朝，因劫惠王，置之髙府，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"q60_34y_1zh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"yfx_myv_qft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"白公","kind":"perso